ite/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Focus on sustainable, long-term search visibility</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Fully aligned with modern Answer Engine and AI search requirements</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section id="how" class="scroll-mt-28" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:254:9"><h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-bold lg:text-3xl" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:255:11">How AI Overviews choose their sources</h2><div class="space-y-6" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:121:5"><p class="text-balance-pretty text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:125:13">AI Overviews are grounded in search results. Google retrieves candidate pages, extracts passages that answer the query and its likely follow-ups, then synthesises a summary with links to a small number of sources. Pages that rank well, answer precisely and carry unambiguous structure are chosen disproportionately often.</p><div data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:132:13"><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:133:31">Observed patterns in cited pages</h3><ul class="space-y-2" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:134:15"><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Direct answer within the first 100 words of the relevant section</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Heading text that mirrors the query phrasing</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Supporting lists,