ponents/site/sections.tsx:155:21">1</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">Query classification</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Identify which of your priority queries currently trigger an AI Overview and who is cited.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">2</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">Passage engineering</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Rewrite the matching sections answer-first with query-mirroring headings.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">3</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">Cluster completion</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Fill topical gaps so your site demonstrably covers the whole subject, not one page of it.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">4</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">Schema and entity work</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Article, FAQPage, Organization and author markup to remove ambiguity.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">5</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">Authority support</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Links and mentions that lift the underlying page into the candidate set.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">6</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">Monitoring</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Monthly tracking of Overview presence and citation for each tracked query.</span></span></li></ol></div></div></section><section id="traffic" class="scroll-mt-28" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:254:9"><h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-bold lg:text-3xl" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:255:11">What AI Overviews do to your traffic</h2><div class="space-y-6" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:121:5"><p class="text-balance-pretty text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:125:13">Informational queries lose clicks when an Overview answers them completely. Commercial queries behave differently: users click through to compare, price and buy. The strategic response is to shift content investment towards commercial and comparison intent while keeping enough informational coverage to be recognised as an authority.</p><div class="rounded-xl border-l-4 border-amber bg-amber/10 p-5" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:240:11"><p class="font-display font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:241:13">Track impressions, not just clicks</p><p class="mt-1 text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:242:13">A rising impression count with flat clicks usually means Overview exposure. We report both, plus branded search growth, so the brand effect is not mistaken for a loss.</p></div></div></section></div><div class="mt-14" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/PageTemplate.tsx:136:13"><div id="faqs" class="scroll-mt-28" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:289:5"><h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold lg:text-3xl" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:290:7">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card px-5" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:293:7" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:295:11"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex" data-tsd-source="/src/components/ui/accordion.tsx:21:3"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_3diiq_" class="flex flex-1 items-center